          "request": {
            "name": "Exchange client credentials for a Bearer access token.",
            "description": {
              "content": "OAuth2 client-credentials grant. An Application's client_id and client_secret are exchanged for a short-lived Bearer access token that is sent on the Authorization header of GraphQL requests. Served from the auth host (https://auth.us-east-2.propeldata.com).",
